peranto;and to ensure that our students\"},{\"width\":0.3717693798044786,\"y\":0.6742671008276095,\"height\":0.0146863875249309,\"x\":0.09145130038934436,\"text\":\"may spend their leisure time meaningfully.\"},{\"width\":0.3484224533652239,\"y\":0.6562998484929317,\"height\":0.020660848959261235,\"x\":0.12499822615147818,\"text\":\"Lectures will be organized during this\"},{\"width\":0.38394820541409036,\"y\":0.6426548743567394,\"height\":0.016770893432418332,\"x\":0.08933614139939554,\"text\":\"summer vacation to let the pupils know more\"},{\"width\":0.3797216568401154,\"y\":0.6293159608720833,\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"x\":0.09145129533739772,\"text\":\"about linguistics. The lectures are held on\"},{\"width\":0.22266401539086866,\"y\":0.6133550489761275,\"height\":0.01600541602516803,\"x\":0.08946322315943638,\"text\":\"5th,Tth, and 8th July.\"},{\"width\":0.38170973289884136,\"y\":0.6002906979485086,\"height\":0.013081394655308443,\"x\":0.08946321864004271,\"text\":\"open to all students and our lecturer is our\"},{\"width\":0.32688683494527077,\"y\":0.577783591772534,\"height\":0.02462621931144393,\"x\":0.08909196547348015,\"text\":\"society's adviser, Fr. O. Cearbhallain.\"},{\"width\":0.3439363693808489,\"y\":0.5697068405753334,\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"x\":0.12723658260579834,\"text\":\"Investigation forms have been sent to\"},{\"width\":0.3823000114019329,\"y\":0.5516550067388339,\"height\":0.022574006618039988,\"x\":0.09121938639201499,\"text\":\"the students who are interested in linguis-\"},{\"width\":0.04051020141166374,\"y\":0.5409077163324643,\"height\":0.014366850091890648,\"x\":0.08995646281996035,\"text\":\"tiCS.\"},{\"width\":0.1550695789901543,\"y\":0.5420195439832858,\"height\":0.011759525634566836,\"x\":0.14910536696615553,\"text\":\"All classes will\"},{\"width\":0.1255768828638522,\"y\":0.5356839242029994,\"height\":0.018748431873632176,\"x\":0.30401076177399916,\"text\":\"begin during\"},{\"width\":0.031809145541539574,\"y\"