organiz-\"},{\"width\":0.249136368858623,\"y\":0.2579981079008039,\"height\":0.01933016450863323,\"x\":0.5424658427610944,\"text\":\"edl an interclass general quiz.\"},{\"width\":0.11332007695434354,\"y\":0.2615635176337794,\"height\":0.011726384364820874,\"x\":0.8111332034959892,\"text\":\"A model con-\"},{\"width\":0.38369780895756744,\"y\":0.24709302326005433,\"height\":0.011627906774465013,\"x\":0.5407554628837081,\"text\":\"test was held after the Lunar New Year\"},{\"width\":0.09158018523571532,\"y\":0.22943144679200556,\"height\":0.014974316401279775,\"x\":0.5406910218456651,\"text\":\"Holidays.\"},{\"width\":0.286282299674131,\"y\":0.22964169351743224,\"height\":0.013090864299562965,\"x\":0.6381709726281435,\"text\":\"There were about fifty entries\"},{\"width\":0.14910536441361,\"y\":0.21498371307075093,\"height\":0.01335504885993477,\"x\":0.5407554713717239,\"text\":\"from F.l to H.3.\"},{\"width\":0.3439363693808489,\"y\":0.19902280133096495,\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"x\":0.5805169064626571,\"text\":\"In February, our club took part in the\"},{\"width\":0.21669978721469052,\"y\":0.18459302327536653,\"height\":0.014534883778724361,\"x\":0.538767406226982,\"text\":\"Open Day Exhibition.\"},{\"width\":0.15904571750797258,\"y\":0.18306188943622048,\"height\":0.016066017523650555,\"x\":0.7654075592877632,\"text\":\"A model （4'x 11'）\"},{\"width\":0.38369780895756733,\"y\":0.16860465089164567,\"height\":0.01453488377872425,\"x\":0.5407554719625682,\"text\":\"was made and it attracted many visitors. In\"},{\"width\":0.38592504817534246,\"y\":0.15255959453910695,\"height\":0.0166011698471219,\"x\":0.5386660129370707,\"text\":\"June, a history essay competition was jointly\"},{\"width\":0.34990059755702707,\"y\":0.13941368058587933,\"height\":0.0161095752778192,\"x\":0.5387673909497835,\"text\":\"organized by the Starlet and our club.\"},{\"width\":0.037773360118083965,\"y\":0.13941368078876737,\"height\":0.011749109771430288,\"x\":0.8866799198664053,\"text\":\"The\"},{\"width\":0.38587774864917557,\"y\":0.1232128165568519,\"height\":0.01728427029587931,\"x\":0.5386685399116561,\"text\":\"participants showed immense interest and\"},{\"width\":0.38170973289884136,\"y\":0.10901162782963003,\"height\":0.014534883778724361,\"x\":0.5427435367314941,\"text\":\"enthusiasm in history. There will be an ex-\"},{\"width\":0.31839005577373003,\"y\":0.09438138822444908,\"height\":0.01543233914949993,\"x\":0.5386636756978802,\"text\":\"cursion for all students in summer.\"},{\"width\":0.34019870044075873,\"y\":0.07695190583690326,\"height\":0.014867019032034134,\"x\":0.5843675144432904,\"text\":\"Finally, we would like to take this op-\"},{\"width\":0.37995807287314787,\"y\":0.059870380027012615,\"height\":0.017606904219338526,\"x\":0.5446181067426947,\"text\":\"portunity to extend our gratitude to our\"},{\"width\":0.38170973289884136,\"y\":0.04941860492525274,\"height\":0.013122111888972499,\"x\":0.5427435367314941,\"text\":\"adlvisers and all those who had contributed\"},{\"width\":0.26691769958604894,\"y\":0.029729283680596907,\"height\":0.018598406167294357,\"x\":0.5464570180756559,\"text\":\"uheir support during the year.\"}]",
