        "text": "[{\"width\":0.4632206609117369,\"y\":0.9026058631909128,\"height\":0.03648208469055381,\"x\":0.05566601406588985,\"text\":\"LINGUISTIC\"},{\"width\":0.3558647985339377,\"y\":0.8589576549041221,\"height\":0.03648208469055381,\"x\":0.05765408362567524,\"text\":\"SOCIETY\"},{\"width\":0.32637298638382906,\"y\":0.8777849133699627,\"height\":0.017701123514082262,\"x\":0.5445775599013393,\"text\":\"Adviser: Fr. O. Cearbhallain，\"},{\"width\":0.05367793118889952,\"y\":0.877850162722828,\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"x\":0.8707753483419318,\"text\":\"S.J.\"},{\"width\":0.3304277443843304,\"y\":0.8557242348929924,\"height\":0.017700758197796818,\"x\":0.5445354218386239,\"text\":\"Chairman: Fung Wah（F.5B）\"},{\"width\":0.3439363693808489,\"y\":0.7934853421963028,\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"x\":0.12922466173104658,\"text\":\"ur society was established by a group of\"},{\"width\":0.3697813037457525,\"y\":0.7761627913621334,\"height\":0.026162789310616885,\"x\":0.1033797295585352,\"text\":\"Usndenuswhoare mnterered in lingwitics\"},{\"width\":0.3439363693808489,\"y\":0.767426710026341,\"height\":0.011726384364820763,\"x\":0.1292246554437705,\"text\":\"It was formed in the second term of the\"},{\"width\":0.04174950203581078,\"y\":0.7500000001374768,\"height\":0.011627906774464902,\"x\":0.09145129324153796,\"text\":\"year.\"},{\"width\":0.34194829332212295,\"y\":0.7338762217299795,\"height\":0.014670289999498931,\"x\":0.13121273634092653,\"text\":\"Our chief aims are: to make pen-friend-\"},{\"width\":0.3799225506298044,\"y\":0.7179189732826714,\"height\":0.017659180482746395,\"x\":0.09134494343092012,\"text\":\"ship between our schoolmates and foreign\"},{\"width\":0.3817097328988413,\"y\":0.7034883723642568,\"height\":0.01605560166051412,\"x\":0.09145130134381979,\"text\":\"students; to spread languages, especially Es-\"},{\"width\":0.38170973289884136,\"y\":0.6904069772544679,\"height\":0.013176084884991557,\"x\":0.09145129443527124,\"text\":\"peranto;and to ensure that our students\"},{\"width\":0.3717693798044786,\"y\":0.6742671008276095,\"height\":0.0146863875249309,\"x\":0.09145130038934436,\"text\":\"may spend their leisure time meaningfully.\"},{\"width\":0.3484224533652239,\"y\":0.6562998484929317,\"height\":0.020660848959261235,\"x\":0.12499822615147818,\"text\":\"Lectures will be organized during this\"},{\"width\":0.38394820541409036,\"y\":0.6426548743567394,\"height\":0.016770893432418332,\"x\":0.08933614139939554,\"text\":\"summer vacation to let the pupils know more\"},{\"width\":0.3797216568401154,\"y\":0.6293159608720833,\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"x\":0.09145129533739772,\"text\":\"about linguistics. The lectures are held on\"},{\"width\":0.22266401539086866,\"y\":0.6133550489761275,\"height\":0.01600541602516803,\"x\":0.08946322315943638,\"text\":\"5th,Tth, and 8th July.\"},{\"width\":0.38170973289884136,\"y\":0.6002906979485086,\"height\":0.013081394655308443,\"x\":0.08946321864004271,\"text\":\"open to all students and our lecturer is our\"},{\"width\":0.32688683494527077,\"y\":0.577783591772534,\"height\":0.02462621931144393,\"x\":0.08909196547348015,\"text\":\"society's adviser, Fr. O. Cearbhallain.\"},{\"width\":0.3439363693808489,\"y\":0.5697068405753334,\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"x\":0.12723658260579834,\"text\":\"Investigation forms have been sent to\"},{\"width\":0.3823000114019329,\"y\":0.5516550067388339,\"height\":0.022574006618039988,\"x\":0.09121938639201499,\"text\":\"the students who are interested in linguis-\"},{\"width\":0.04051020141166374,\"y\":0.5409077163324643,\"height\":0.014366850091890648,\"x\":0.08995646281996035,\"text\":\"tiCS.\"},{\"width\":0.1550695789901543,\"y\":0.5420195439832858,\"height\":0.011759525634566836,\"x\":0.14910536696615553,\"text\":\"All classes will\"},{\"width\":0.1255768828638522,\"y\":0.5356839242029994,\"height\":0.018748431873632176,\"x\":0.30401076177399916,\"text\":\"begin during\"},{\"width\":0.031809145541539574,\"y\":0.5406976746089874,\"height\":0.010174418272335228,\"x\":0.44135188899198696,\"text\":\"the\"},{\"width\":0.3797216568401153,\"y\":0.5231270360245943,\"height\":0.01466366149703524,\"x\":0.09145130137616496,\"text\":\"summer vacation, and some linguists were\"},{\"width\":0.3820123247496798,\"y\":0.5095320560007663,\"height\":0.015253576471285224,\"x\":0.09129592434504592,\"text\":\"invited to be the advisers of different lan-\"},{\"width\":0.05972953021207594,\"y\":0.4955009699504602,\"height\":0.010451549194534726,\"x\":0.09140760144511695,\"text\":\"g1ages.\"},{\"width\":0.167868112710283,\"y\":0.7127656687549531,\"height\":0.09620741058250204,\"x\":0.5250949425866756,\"text\":\"DUTCH\"},{\"width\":0.15523738487094052,\"y\":0.7685481538360496,\"height\":0.02104322824881988,\"x\":0.7335145070683483,\"text\":\"JAPANESE\"},{\"width\":0.17727918165890288,\"y\":0.7271456927761588,\"height\":0.05568133922663887,\"x\":0.6829733428780961,\"text\":\"ESPERANTO\"},{\"width\":0.1996874885763077,\"y\":0.6742357326508239,\"height\":0.06419282347837574,\"x\":0.5459207239905121,\"text\":\"ILA④J\"},{\"width\":0.08752227892000197,\"y\":0.7063106747834826,\"height\":0.01325074360502665,\"x\":0.7733362769214424,\"text\":\"ENGLISH\"},{\"width\":0.21130372453713375,\"y\":0.6600539919058932,\"height\":0.02872922692314428,\"x\":0.6836125524190677,\"text\":\"GERMAN\"},{\"width\":0.11544352376737266,\"y\":0.6247931857881197,\"height\":0.020762465908783723,\"x\":0.5605684974591005,\"text\":\"FRENCH\"},{\"width\":0.34050480099710345,\"y\":0.5491466818350227,\"height\":0.01746757209106853,\"x\":0.5882088914633706,\"text\":\"The classes held are to be free of charge\"},{\"width\":0.3797216568401153,\"y\":0.5363372095764156,\"height\":0.013174191204655017,\"x\":0.5487077537204329,\"text\":\"to all Wah Yan students. We will also allow\"},{\"width\":0.38216219271355567,\"y\":0.51880210093615,\"height\":0.01793768693259168,\"x\":0.546560635377154,\"text\":\"students of other schools to attend our classes，\"},{\"width\":0.09748965448661717,\"y\":0.5042389456828483,\"height\":0.016231411365422055,\"x\":0.5446945354067368,\"text\":\"if possible.\"},{\"width\":0.6043737618893439,\"y\":0.41270358291699827,\"height\":0.03648208469055381,\"x\":0.05566600295194834,\"text\":\"HISTORY CLUB\"},{\"width\":0.3363058324803643,\"y\":0.14629506512440638,\"height\":0.017866399932761845,\"x\":0.12908596032487063,\"text\":\"series of lectures were held during last\"},{\"width\":0.0797356386235691,\"y\":0.1332562367703376,\"height\":0.011103805889912444,\"x\":0.113213692546544,\"text\":\"summer.\"},{\"width\":0.07157057491853278,\"y\":0.13517441881441372,\"height\":0.010174418272335228,\"x\":0.22266401743138967,\"text\":\"Students\"},{\"width\":0.043737574694628356,\"y\":0.13517441889798942,\"height\":0.01017441827233534,\"x\":0.3141153075831033,\"text\":\"from\"},{\"width\":0.08966620678145193,\"y\":0.13047269757926216,\"height\":0.015217395248164567,\"x\":0.3756440337684097,\"text\":\"Naryknoll\"},{\"width\":0.3439363693808489,\"y\":0.11918604702190982,\"height\":0.013081394655308443,\"x\":0.12127236891295531,\"text\":\"Sisters'School and St. Paul's Convent\"},{\"width\":0.3797216568401153,\"y\":0.10456026067318303,\"height\":0.011726384364820874,\"x\":0.08548708790200986,\"text\":\"School were invited to attend the lectures\"},{\"width\":0.17097414666106142,\"y\":0.08859934877982689,\"height\":0.011726384364820763,\"x\":0.08548708458862093,\"text\":\"with our members.\"},{\"width\":0.18290257581415031,\"y\":0.08859934858602836,\"height\":0.011726384364820874,\"x\":0.2803180983089619,\"text\":\"A seminar was held\"},{\"width\":0.38008740539006797,\"y\":0.0708802604188018,\"height\":0.01796404934861373,\"x\":0.08531909549598327,\"text\":\"after all these lectures were over. Pamph-\"},{\"width\":0.38170973289884136,\"y\":0.05667752429993067,\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"x\":0.08349900392831311,\"text\":\"lets were printed and distributed to those\"},{\"width\":0.276733235241895,\"y\":0.042042231592482326,\"height\":0.01636914119658328,\"x\":0.08533794709692998,\"text\":\"who had attended the lectures.\"},{\"width\":0.021868787347314178,\"y\":0.024709302484860363,\"height\":0.011772782018207972,\"x\":0.4771371771215715,\"text\":\"59\"},{\"width\":0.1530815029314282,\"y\":0.3895348837736202,\"height\":0.011768047817366956,\"x\":0.5447316117880965,\"text\":\"Adviser: Fr.|\"},{\"width\":0.15109344047233597,\"y\":0.3866279073533556,\"height\":0.01598837165956779,\"x\":0.6938369782528976,\"text\":\"McGaley, S.J.\"},{\"width\":0.14512922589579158,\"y\":0.364820846616999,\"height\":0.014657980456025954,\"x\":0.6441351900590624,\"text\":\"Mrs. H. Lee\"},{\"width\":0.32007951107467136,\"y\":0.34592833891119845,\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"x\":0.5467196900889069,\"text\":\"Chairman : Lo Chit Ki （L6A）\"},{\"width\":0.3439363693808488,\"y\":0.3197674418897076,\"height\":0.01453488377872425,\"x\":0.58051690821216,\"text\":\"We had a gathering for our members\"},{\"width\":0.3859267889284622,\"y\":0.3032687802458264,\"height\":0.017349381089598825,\"x\":0.538649038781756,\"text\":\"at the beginning of the academic year. In\"},{\"width\":0.09754983966575803,\"y\":0.2904250556084209,\"height\":0.013626632938944172,\"x\":0.5387002276486909,\"text\":\"November，\"},{\"width\":0.031809145541539574,\"y\":0.2905537459040255,\"height\":0.013355048859934882,\"x\":0.6500994032232661,\"text\":\"the\"},{\"width\":0.09356848568839826,\"y\":0.28758673583160965,\"height\":0.016396295752509782,\"x\":0.6997366307391722,\"text\":\"Geography\"},{\"width\":0.08946321864816587,\"y\":0.2905537462130686,\"height\":0.011771835178039813,\"x\":0.8011928454472889,\"text\":\"Soclety，\"},{\"width\":0.031809145541539574,\"y\":0.29055374605802986,\"height\":0.011771835178039813,\"x\":0.8926441346646179,\"text\":\"the\"},{\"width\":0.387673933875752,\"y\":0.27166123753939153,\"height\":0.017589576547231256,\"x\":0.5367793304030783,\"text\":\"Science Society and our club jointly organiz-\"},{\"width\":0.249136368858623,\"y\":0.2579981079008039,\"height\":0.01933016450863323,\"x\":0.5424658427610944,\"text\":\"edl an interclass general quiz.\"},{\"width\":0.11332007695434354,\"y\":0.2615635176337794,\"height\":0.011726384364820874,\"x\":0.8111332034959892,\"text\":\"A model con-\"},{\"width\":0.38369780895756744,\"y\":0.24709302326005433,\"height\":0.011627906774465013,\"x\":0.5407554628837081,\"text\":\"test was held after the Lunar New Year\"},{\"width\":0.09158018523571532,\"y\":0.22943144679200556,\"height\":0.014974316401279775,\"x\":0.5406910218456651,\"text\":\"Holidays.\"},{\"width\":0.286282299674131,\"y\":0.22964169351743224,\"height\":0.013090864299562965,\"x\":0.6381709726281435,\"text\":\"There were about fifty entries\"},{\"width\":0.14910536441361,\"y\":0.21498371307075093,\"height\":0.01335504885993477,\"x\":0.5407554713717239,\"text\":\"from F.l to H.3.\"},{\"width\":0.3439363693808489,\"y\":0.19902280133096495,\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"x\":0.5805169064626571,\"text\":\"In February, our club took part in the\"},{\"width\":0.21669978721469052,\"y\":0.18459302327536653,\"height\":0.014534883778724361,\"x\":0.538767406226982,\"text\":\"Open Day Exhibition.\"},{\"width\":0.15904571750797258,\"y\":0.18306188943622048,\"height\":0.016066017523650555,\"x\":0.7654075592877632,\"text\":\"A model （4'x 11'）\"},{\"width\":0.38369780895756733,\"y\":0.16860465089164567,\"height\":0.01453488377872425,\"x\":0.5407554719625682,\"text\":\"was made and it attracted many visitors. In\"},{\"width\":0.38592504817534246,\"y\":0.15255959453910695,\"height\":0.0166011698471219,\"x\":0.5386660129370707,\"text\":\"June, a history essay competition was jointly\"},{\"width\":0.34990059755702707,\"y\":0.13941368058587933,\"height\":0.0161095752778192,\"x\":0.5387673909497835,\"text\":\"organized by the Starlet and our club.\"},{\"width\":0.037773360118083965,\"y\":0.13941368078876737,\"height\":0.011749109771430288,\"x\":0.8866799198664053,\"text\":\"The\"},{\"width\":0.38587774864917557,\"y\":0.1232128165568519,\"height\":0.01728427029587931,\"x\":0.5386685399116561,\"text\":\"participants showed immense interest and\"},{\"width\":0.38170973289884136,\"y\":0.10901162782963003,\"height\":0.014534883778724361,\"x\":0.5427435367314941,\"text\":\"enthusiasm in history. There will be an ex-\"},{\"width\":0.31839005577373003,\"y\":0.09438138822444908,\"height\":0.01543233914949993,\"x\":0.5386636756978802,\"text\":\"cursion for all students in summer.\"},{\"width\":0.34019870044075873,\"y\":0.07695190583690326,\"height\":0.014867019032034134,\"x\":0.5843675144432904,\"text\":\"Finally, we would like to take this op-\"},{\"width\":0.37995807287314787,\"y\":0.059870380027012615,\"height\":0.017606904219338526,\"x\":0.5446181067426947,\"text\":\"portunity to extend our gratitude to our\"},{\"width\":0.38170973289884136,\"y\":0.04941860492525274,\"height\":0.013122111888972499,\"x\":0.5427435367314941,\"text\":\"adlvisers and all those who had contributed\"},{\"width\":0.26691769958604894,\"y\":0.029729283680596907,\"height\":0.018598406167294357,\"x\":0.5464570180756559,\"text\":\"uheir support during the year.\"}]",
